    "created_at": "2016-07-06T15:47:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-06T15:47:37Z",
    "body": "To preserve compatibility, I think we should go back to the old definition, which best reflects currently interoperable behavior, even though it does not take advantage of the fact that it is possible to getComputedStyle on an element that is not in the tree.  Any objections?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
