    "created_at": "2016-07-06T16:07:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-06T16:07:38Z",
    "body": "@annevk: Although it is possible to call getComputedStyle on an out-of-tree element, its style does not get computed.  You just end up with a blank CSSStyleDeclaration object, with no usable value for the \"color\" attribute.\nhttps://jsfiddle.net/6r5cucm8/\n",
